ok   handlers 2: an unread pipeline of 1 MiB replies runs a bounded number of handlers
ok   handlers 2: every pipelined reply arrives once the client reads
ok   handlers 0: an unread pipeline of 1 MiB replies runs a bounded number of handlers
ok   handlers 0: every pipelined reply arrives once the client reads
ok   a request without Host is answered after the earlier response
ok   CONNECT is answered after the earlier response
ok   a bad target is answered after the earlier response
